{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/366752-just-for-fun-best-compromise-rolls","id":366752,"title":"Just for Fun: Best Compromise Rolls","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-11T17:47:19-08:00","id":366752,"title":"Just for Fun: Best Compromise Rolls","content":"We have stories of times when the table breaks down laughing. Last night, we had this exchange.<br /> <br /> <i>A pair of hitmen have broken into the residence of a Korean-American blue collar worker, his wife, mother, and daughter (The cover for the group's Messenger-Integrator). Hitman A goes into the kitchen, triggering one of the defensive alarms the player set up earlier in the chronicle. The player then gets the drop on the on the hitman with a compact handgun.<br /> <br /> The player's cover is a seven year old girl in Disney princess pajamas.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Storyteller as Hitman A</b>: Sweetie, that's not a toy, why don't you put that down and you can go to bed.<br /> <br /> <i>A second passes.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Seven-year-old girl</b>: Kneecap or crotch? Bitch.<br /> <br /> <i>Table erupts in laughter.</i><br /> <br /> <b>Storyteller</b>: ...And that is a compromise roll.<br /> <br /> <i>The player had three different conditions on her at the time, and had spent the entire session having one bad thing after another happen. She racked up 4 beats during the ensuing fight alone. Her response afterwords? </i>&quot;Worth it.&quot;<br /> <br /> Any other stories to share?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2233,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","user":"Agentwestmer","date":". 01-11-2015, 11:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https